OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fisolated showers around in the west at
OL,7,Ffirst. Elsewhere remaining dry with
OL,8,Fclear skies. Winds turn increasingly
OL,9,Flight. A chillier night than yesterday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with showery
OL,12,Foutbreaks further north and west to
OL,13,Fstart on Wednesday, becoming drier by
OL,14,Fmidday with long sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in that
OL,16,Fsunshine with light southwesterly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
